  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Once a roadie for the legendary Subchain City band, 'The Cracked Quills,' Gasser Gulch saw his bandmates succumb to the DRIP wars. Now, haunted by their MIDI melodies, he roams the wastes, dispensing icy justice with his modified Cryo-Gasser, seeking retribution for the fallen rockers.",
    "class": "Cryo-Punk",
    "name": "Gasser Gulch",
    "personality": "Melancholy and brooding, Gasser Gulch is a loner, often found tinkering with his Cryo-Gasser or quietly mourning his band. He's fiercely loyal to anyone who reminds him of his old crew, ready to unleash a frozen fury on anyone who threatens them. Despite his gruff exterior, he has a soft spot for lost hatchlings, remembering his own days as a fledgling musician.",
